Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:38:14 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/16] ARM: exynos: boot mainline AArch32 on Galaxy Note 4
 (Exynos5433)

- allow Exynos5433 clk/pinctrl drivers on 32-bit ARM (SOC_EXYNOS5433)
- note4-seclog: mirror printk into Samsung sec_log (last_kmsg)
- early asm markers into sec_log, map sec_log in early page tables
